OL,3,AMale prisons in England and Wales have
OL,4,Afewer than 1,800 spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FMale prisons have fewer than 1,800
OL,7,Fspaces available in England and Wales,
OL,8,Fthe lowest level since March.
OL,10,FMore than 83,000 spaces are occupied by
OL,11,Fmale inmates, despite the government
OL,12,Fintroducing a presumption against
OL,13,Fjailing anyone for under one year to
OL,14,Ffree up more space.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
