OL,3,AMale prisons in England and Wales have
OL,4,Afewer than 1,800 spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrison staff told the BBC the high
OL,7,Flevel of offenders being recalled to
OL,8,Fprison for breaching license conditions
OL,9,Fgiven on their release or re-offending
OL,10,Fhas cancelled out much of the extra
OL,11,Froom. Since June, there has been a
OL,12,Fdownward trend in the number of vacant
OL,13,Fspaces.
OL,15,FThe spike comes before the government
OL,16,Fis set to release about 5,000 inmates
OL,17,Fearly from October to alleviate
OL,18,Fovercrowding.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
